#passage(("He's also making false claims about alMasjid alAqsa being built over 200 years, and that Muslims promised the Jews rebuilding of the temple. Of course, he doesn't offer any evidence for that, because there is nothing of that sort in Islamic history. And also, we know that all the Jewish tribes in Medina, they betrayed The Prophetﷺ treaties and they all broke the treaties. So they weren't aligned with the Muslims. In fact, the year 7 AH, they betrayed the Muslims and aligned with the Pagan Arabs, and Muslims were in the middle; they were ambushed by them. So this idea that we promised them, if you help us, we allow you to do this, is completely false.", "Also, the Dome of the Rock: why is it called the Dome of the Rock? Because the rock there is believed to be the rock of The Prophetﷺ, where he did his journey of Isra-and-Mi'raj, where he ascended to heaven. The rock is there. So who built this Dome of the Rock? It was 'Abd alMalik ibn Marwan, and it was in the year 66 AH. You have like 56 years or 60 years after The Prophetﷺ, you have him building it. And it was a problem because 'Abdullah ibn azZubayr was in Mecca, and Abdullah ibn azZubayr, who was a son of a Companion, he didn't agree with his authority, and he was speaking against him in Mecca. So he didn't like it. And what he did is he told the people: don't go to do pilgrimage in Mecca. But of course, people revolt: how can you stop us from doing pilgrimage? So what he did instead is he built the people this mosque of the Dome of the Rock, and he says to people: OK, here's the mosque of the Dome of the Rock, so he can try and bring people closer to him. That was the reason why he built it. He built that in 66 AH, for no reason to do with Judaism whatsoever at all.", "But this idea that the mosque was built in 200 years is false. Even the mosque of the Qibla, which I referred to, it was built by 'Umar ibn alKhattab, like 15 AH or something; has nothing to do with the Jewish people as well, AT ALL. So essentially everything he's saying is false historically.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Responding To Professor Jiang's Lecture On The Islamic Golden Age | Muhammed Ali!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SVGKQ-xiGs", ((4639, "1:17:19–1:17:51"), (4677, "1:17:57–1:18:56"), (4742, "1:19:02–1:19:30"),), id: 3137)

