#passage(("Now, this is a lesson for us as Muslims, so we can understand that we should not be seeking validation. We should not be looking up to individuals in the West, any everyone who just speaks few words about Islam; now you start looking up to him as a role model, and you think that that individual is your saviour now, and you start taking your religion from him! Allahﷻ has warned us. Allahﷻ says in the (Quran3:118-119) یَـٰۤأَیُّهَا ٱلَّذِینَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَتَّخِذُوا۟ بِطَانَةࣰ مِّن دُونِكُمۡ (O you who believe do not take allies, close allies from other than yourselves, from someone who is not a Muslim) لَا یَأۡلُونَكُمۡ خَبَالࣰا (they waiting for any chance -any chance they have- to do anything to you, they will do it to you) وَدُّوا۟ مَا عَنِتُّمۡ (they love when they see you struggle). They love when they see oppression happening to you; they love all of these things. قَدۡ بَدَتِ ٱلۡبَغۡضَاۤءُ مِنۡ أَفۡوَ ٰ⁠هِهِمۡ (the hatred have manifested from their mouths) وَمَا تُخۡفِی صُدُورُهُمۡ أَكۡبَرُۚ (and what their heart conceals is even larger) قَدۡ بَیَّنَّا لَكُمُ ٱلۡـَٔایَـٰتِۖ (Allah has made the signs for you) إِن كُنتُمۡ تَعۡقِلُونَ ۝ (if you have a mind -if you understand, if you reflect-). هَـٰۤأَنتُمۡ أُو۟لَاۤءِ تُحِبُّونَهُمۡ وَلَا یُحِبُّونَكُمۡ Then Allah says in the next verse: (Here you are, you love them and they do not love you) (and you believe in the full book and when they see you they say we believe and then when they turn their back, they start biting their nails from the hatred -from the anger that they have, from the envy that they have towards you-).", "So Allahﷻ has warned you. He told you not to take allies; he told you not just anyone who you see just praising the religion, therefore that is a good person now that we should follow and we should praise and we should look up to. And I have been warning, and many brothers have been warning, that we should not be having this superiority complex and looking at people in the West as if they are superior, and if they say something, now we start sharing it out around Muslims: \"Look, someone said something good about Islam\"! We have our own religion; we should be proud [of] our own religion, and this is what we need to care about, nothing else.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Situation In Palestine, Jordan Peterson And A Lesson For Muslims! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U5HX8nV6kcY", ((514, "8:34–9:48"), (594, "9:54–10:17"),), id: 3142)
