ry to move to? They moved to those countries because these countries have a good economic status. So you cannot then say they have good economic status because they moved there, because that is a self-refuting argument. So my point was: what is the reason? Because they have oil, but they did not have colonisation trying to take the oil through military colonisation; that's why they are better than other countries which were destroyed by colonisation. So you asking them to recover, when still colonisation happens, doesn't make any rational sense.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Dismantles French Nationalism And Racist Ideologies! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CTdeXBAESWc", ((1408, "23:28–25:17"), (1534, "25:34–27:43"),), id: 3144)
