#passage(("These questions to do with the whole Community is to be given to Scholars. The reason is simple: the leader of Pakistan, does he do the same thing as the leader of Algeria? Does he do the same thing as the leader of Tunisia? Does he do the same thing as the leader of Egypt? No. Every country has a different situation; every country has different issues. Now, the problem is when you have people who are not people of knowledge given a general ruling for every country, as if the situation is applicable to everyone, and that's just a sign of ignorance. That's why, when they ask a question, they say: ask [scholars] with your country. They are already Scholars, by the way. Speaking about this or that government or [leader], it's not as simple as one to one accountability here. Go to the scholars, people of knowledge, and they will know what is the best scenario, the best situation, what is the best advice to give. Last time I checked, the presidents are not following your profile and taking your advice and changing their policies. So, Allah knows best; I say: go to the scholars regarding whichever country you're referring to, whichever situation, whichever incident, because this is a very general question. Go to the scholars there, and they will give you the best answer regarding it.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Eddie @TheDeenShowTV Interviews The Muslim Lantern | Masjid Dar Al-Qur'an | Chicago - USA”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sLfJyJGj_eg", ((5250, "1:27:30–1:29:16"),), id: 3148)

