#passage(("So I hope people can actually open their minds a bit more and actually do an investigation: is that actually what Muslims believe? Rather than just listening to a random guy, I-made-it-up.com, go and pick up a copy of the Quran and actually read it for yourself. If it's teaching what this guy is telling you is teaching, then you can say, OK, yes, this guy is right and I actually should be wary of these Muslims because this is what their book is teaching. But if he's just I-made-it-up.com stats, then know that these people are not reliable for you to take as an authority and take information from.", "I hope Muslims as well take this as a lesson that we'll have to struggle. We'll have to always take blame for things we didn't do. We'll have to come and clarify and condemn. Even when I live in a complete different country, I've never met this person or heard about him in my life, but I have to condemn it, because Muslims have a different standard when it comes to dealing with them. Whether it's the media or general people, they have a different standard and we have to act in a certain way, because this is life: we're targeted and we have to behave in a way to justify and respond to things that we didn't do.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Responding To @PBDPodcast Absurd Comments On The Bishop Incident! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=je-cOqAbR8c", ((1911, "31:51–32:16"), (1944, "32:24–32:48"),), id: 3155)
// U ML103:422-446 | The Muslim Lantern | 2
#passage(("My advice is: as Muslims, you need to be careful, you need to defend yourself. You need to be together in communities, not far away from each other. You need to support one each other, protect one another. That's what we need to do, because at this point, they are promoting actual unaliving of people! And this is exactly what they want. This is exactly the plan of the Zionist movement. What do they want? They want to turn the eyes away from Gaza and the genocide that is happening. So in America, they did what they did with the Kirk situation, so they can turn the left on the right, and they have all of these people unaliving each other, and attacking each other, and busy with one another. And they do the same thing in the UK: focus on the immigrant, focus on the Muslims.", "And they think: you know what? If all the immigrants are gone, all our problems are going to be fixed! While they are just a bunch of belly pregnant men drinking alcohol. And they think they're going to change the situation if the immigrants are not there, who are actually holding the country together, participating in NHS, participating in police force, participating in all of these things. So it's a very dangerous mentality. It's very important that we are even more cautious as Muslims, and we need to fight back this nonsense. And I'm not talking about fighting back with physical force. I'm talking about educating individuals, telling people, trying our best to remove these misconceptions that people are having. That is the only thing that we have in our hands at this point.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Islam Should Be Banned?! The Quran CAN Be Replicated?! | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hIakD_VbeU", ((1109, "18:29–19:11"), (1155, "19:15–19:50"),), id: 3156)

