#passage(("This issue is not about Morocco or Moroccans. If you go to different Muslim lands, you'll find similar issues there. You'll find as well women not dressed in a Hijab way, having Feministic ideas, because they've been influenced by the west. The point is, someone coming from the west, because he sees how the west has fallen when it comes to these issues, he's going to the Muslims and he's not realizing that many of these Muslims have been also influenced by that west that he is running away from and he thinks it's falling. And they have been influenced by them and they think that they are superior morally, etc. So, we need to be clear on our stances when it comes to these issues. But to be fair, it's not like everyone gave an incorrect answer. There are some people, Alhamdulillah (Thanks to God), who gave correct answers, very good answers, and Alhamdulillah there is خير (khir: goodness) in this Ummah (Nation).", "But in order for there to be goodness in this Ummah, we need to understand that we need to enjoin the good and forbid the evil (الأمر بالمعروف والنهي عن المنكر). The reason Allahﷻ praised our Nation is He said (Quran3:110): كُنتُمۡ خَیۡرَ أُمَّةٍ أُخۡرِجَتۡ لِلنَّاسِ تَأۡمُرُونَ بِٱلۡمَعۡرُوفِ وَتَنۡهَوۡنَ عَنِ ٱلۡمُنكَرِ (you are the best Nation to be brought up to the people). Why? Is because you enjoin the Good and you forbid the Evil. And Allahﷻ said about Bani Israel (children of Israel) (Quran5:79): كَانُوا۟ لَا یَتَنَاهَوۡنَ عَن مُّنكَرࣲ فَعَلُوهُۚ They did not forbid each other when they were doing sins. They didn't care when other people were doing sins. So, this is a problem! You cannot say \"oh let the people do what they want to do\". No! There is a level of enjoining the good and forbidding the evil.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim vs Woke | What Islam Actually Says - Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8tefi4j0jMY", ((724, "12:04–12:55"), (779, "12:59–13:21"),), id: 3157)
// R quran_003_110.json
#refbox("Reference text: Quran 3:110, quran.com (Saheeh International)", (("3:110", "You are the best nation produced [as an example] for mankind. You enjoin what is right and forbid what is wrong and believe in Allāh. If only the People of the Scripture had believed, it would have been better for them. Among them are believers, but most of them are defiantly disobedient."),))
